    Bug 2052647 - Port Bug 1849907, tab selected/visuallyselected are now boolean attributes. r=tobyp

    Bug 1849907 converted the tab element's selected and visuallyselected attributes
    to standard boolean attributes (selected="" / visuallyselected="") and updated
    Firefox's own selectors. Update Thunderbird's tabmail CSS and the
    browser_appearance.js test to match [selected] / [visuallyselected] instead of
    the old ="true" form. Non-tab elements (richlistitem, attachment/chat list
    items) are unaffected and left unchanged.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D310465

